+> **Description:** Hexabot positions itself as an open-source AI chatbot and agent builder with multi-channel, multilingual, and text-to-action capabilities. The README highlights a visual editor, plugin system, inbox handoff, analytics, knowledge-base support, and deployment via Docker. For restaurant operators, that combination is useful for guest messaging, handoff to staff, multilingual menu questions, and basic lead capture for catering or private events. It is more productized than many framework-heavy alternatives while staying self-hostable. On GitHub, Hexabot shows about 926 stars, TypeScript as the primary language, an AGPL-3.0 license, and a last commit on 2025-12-29.
