+#### [faster-whisper](https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper)
+> **Description:** faster-whisper is described in its README as a reimplementation of Whisper using CTranslate2 for faster and more memory-efficient inference. The project focuses on speed, batching, lower hardware cost, and practical deployment. Restaurants building call transcription, multilingual phone support, or kitchen-audio capture systems can use it when Python integration matters more than raw C++ portability. It complements whisper.cpp well: whisper.cpp is excellent for portable edge use, while faster-whisper is convenient inside Python services and batch pipelines. On GitHub, faster-whisper shows about 17.4k stars, Python as the primary language, an MIT license, and recent GitHub activity through 2026-03-18.
